      "side": 1,
      "message": "config.h explicitly checks that at least one discharge option is enabled (if discharge is enabled), but it does not check that only one is enabled. (There is also a GPIO option that I didn\u0027t look into.) I have a pretty vague understanding of the electrical requirements of VBUS discharge. Does anything bad happen if the TCPC and PPC both discharge VBUS?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "f7ce90a20d6d5412c0bcea828e90c0f8350b9aaa",
